# Per-machine configs. The private deployment keeps real ones at exactly these
# names (deploy/config-main.json, deploy/config-nec8.json, deploy/config-n100.json)
# and they carry machine-specific log paths — only the *.example.json templates
# below belong in this repository. Listed here so a hand-sync can't commit one
# by accident.
deploy/config-*.json
!deploy/config-*.example.json

# Timestamped agent backups written by deploy/remote_update.py.
*.bak-*
